Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.68,0:06:19.31,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}原本习惯的日常也全被淘汰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.31,0:06:21.90,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}梦想过平静的安稳生活
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.90,0:06:24.44,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}却因缺乏刺激懒懒散散
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.44,0:06:26.07,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}余辉次第熄
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.07,0:06:29.70,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}我们走惯的道路到底在何方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.70,0:06:32.41,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}偶尔因世态炎凉恼火
